<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;color:<%= t['ink-950'] %>;">Your verification code</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px 0;">Enter this code to open your AEO report:</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px 0;padding:16px;background-color:<%= t['ink-50'] %>;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:8px;color:<%= t['ink-950'] %>;"><%= code %></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;color:<%= t['ink-700'] %>;">The code expires in <%= expiresMinutes %> minutes.</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:<%= t['ink-700'] %>;">If you didn’t ask for this, you can ignore this email — nothing happens unless the code is entered.</p>
